Breakline RMM catalog data

lolrmm_snapshot.json contains tool records from the LOLRMM project
(Living Off the Land RMM) by magicsword-io and its contributors:

  https://github.com/magicsword-io/LOLRMM
  https://lolrmm.io

LOLRMM is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The records are stored unmodified apart from key order, including their
References and Acknowledgement sections, which credit the researchers who
contributed each entry.

tools.json is Breakline's curated catalog. Domains marked "lolrmm:<slug>" are
derived from the matching LOLRMM record; domains marked with a URL come from
that vendor's own documentation.
